            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo mu gihugu yisabīra umugisha n’awusabe Imana y’ukuri, kand’ uwo mu gihugu arahira, n’arahire Imana y’ukuri; kukw amagorwa ya mbere yibagiranye, agahishwa inyonga zanje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
