            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntibazokwubaka ngw abandi binjire; ntibazorima ngw abandi babirye: kuko nk’ukw imyaka y’igiti ingana ari kw abantu banje bazoramba, kand’ abo nitoranirije bazoshitsa igihe kirekire banezererwa igikorwa c’amaboko yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
